Third-party content included in this repository
================================================

Tears of Steel
--------------
The catalog entry for "Tears of Steel" (data/catalog/exclusive_movie_dataset.json)
and its poster (data/catalog/posters.zip, posters/tos-poster.jpg) describe a film that is
(c) copyright Blender Foundation | mango.blender.org, licensed under the Creative
Commons Attribution 3.0 license: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/
The film itself is not included. notebooks/tears-of-steel/ downloads it from
Blender's official mirrors into the deployer's own account, and the app shows
this credit on the film's title page.

Demo media
----------
data/media/football*.zip      Sample football footage supplied by the project owner
                              for use in this open-source demo, re-encoded for the web.
data/media/microdramas-*.zip  AI-generated demo videos made for this project.
data/catalog/movie_dataset.json is a synthetically generated movie catalog, with
its posters, from the aws-samples hyper-personalized agentic AI media assistant
sample (MIT-0).

See data/media/README.md for details.
